  - m_Id: 7747670016
    m_Localized: Self Corrosive Color
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21647593472
    m_Localized: '"Spell power has {buff_0}% effectiveness towards same color enemies
      but has only {buff_1}% effectiveness towards different colored enemies.

      Each
      full bottle provides +{buff_2}% color power buff to the color the bottle is
      filled with."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 6789064481223999584
  - m_Id: 141471258243141632
    m_Localized: Spells are more effective towards same colored enemies but less
      effective towards other enemies. Filled bottles buff their color with +{buff_2}%.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 6789064481223999584
  - m_Id: 141471274668036096
    m_Localized: This solution seems to attack and destroy itself. Strange, this
      needs to be investigated further.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
